@startuml
title CinemaAbyss - Architecture During Migration

actor User

component "API Gateway" as Gateway

component "Monolith Service" as Monolith
component "Movies Service" as Movies
component "Events Service" as Events

database "PostgreSQL (shared)" as DB
queue "Kafka" as Kafka

User --> Gateway

Gateway --> Monolith : /api/users\n/api/payments\n/api/subscriptions
Gateway --> Movies : /api/movies
Gateway --> Events : /api/events

Monolith --> DB
Movies --> DB

Monolith --> Kafka
Movies --> Kafka
Events --> Kafka

note right of Gateway
Gradual traffic migration
using MOVIES_MIGRATION_PERCENT
end note

@enduml